  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Maintaining and Enhancing Water Yield through Land &amp; Forest Rehabilitation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project#s objective is to demonstrate an innovative approach how a pro-active multi stakeholder private sector catalyzed partnership for water stewardship (the Aliansi Air) that already brought together governments, companies, NGOs and other target stakeholders can be up-scaled to achieve transformational changes in the restoration of degraded terrestrial ecosystems.</narrative>
  </description>
